# Whitelist. Everything is ignored unless explicitly allowed below.
*

!*/
!.gitignore
!*.md
!*.py
!*.sh
!*.R

# Data, genomes and figures are not committed. This repository records how
# results were produced; the results themselves remain on the cluster.
*.fa
*.fna
*.faa
*.gz
*.tsv
*.csv
*.pdf
*.png
*.nwk
*.gff
